{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-center-budget-control","title":"成本中心/项目预算与超额审批","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/indirect-budget-settlement/cost-center-budget-control","wordCount":2117,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本中心-项目预算与超额审批\">成本中心/项目预算与超额审批</h1><p>间接采购的花销最终要落到一个预算上，而预算控制最容易犯的错是<strong>控制得太晚</strong>：等到发票入账时才发现这个成本中心已经超支，此时钱已经花出去，任何事后措施都只是补救。正确的位置是把控制点前移到请购提交的那一刻，让系统在钱还没花之前就说「不够」。这一篇讲的就是这套预算占用模型怎么设计，以及超额时给用户哪些出路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-预算的三种口径与占用顺序\">核心概念：预算的三种口径与占用顺序</h2><h3 id=\"预承诺-正式承诺-实支\">预承诺、正式承诺、实支</h3><p>预算不是一个数，而是三个互相关联的数：<strong>原始预算</strong>（期初批准的额度）、<strong>调整后预算</strong>（加上期间内的调入调出）、<strong>可用余额</strong>（调整后预算减去已占用减去已实支）。这三个数的关系必须显式建模，否则「为什么显示还有余额却下不了单」这类争议无法解释。</p>\n<p>占用不是一次性动作，而是随单据状态推进分三段转换。这个三段式在会计上叫承诺占用（encumbrance）：请购产生的是「预计支出但尚无法律义务」的预承诺，采购订单产生的是「未来有法律义务支出」的正式承诺，货物或服务收到并开票后才转为实支、同时释放承诺（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encumbrance\">Encumbrance</a>）。三段的差别不是记账习惯，而是<strong>可撤销性</strong>：预承诺随时可撤（需求取消只需在系统里撤销请购），正式承诺撤销需要与供应商协商（已有订单），实支不可撤销。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>触发单据</th>\n<th>会计含义</th>\n<th>可否撤销</th>\n<th>对可用余额的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预承诺</td>\n<td>请购单提交</td>\n<td>预计支出，无法律义务</td>\n<td>可直接撤销</td>\n<td>占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正式承诺</td>\n<td>采购订单生成</td>\n<td>未来有法律义务</td>\n<td>需与供应商协商</td>\n<td>占用（替换预承诺）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实支</td>\n<td>发票入账</td>\n<td>已发生支出</td>\n<td>不可撤销</td>\n<td>释放承诺、计入已实支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE budget_period (&#10;  budget_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  cost_center_id   VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  period           CHAR(7) NOT NULL,          -- YYYY-MM&#10;  currency         CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  original_amount  NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  adjusted_amount  NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  encumbered_amt   NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  actual_amt       NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  version          INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  UNIQUE (cost_center_id, period)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 可用余额是派生量，绝不能作为可写字段单独维护&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION budget_available(p_cc VARCHAR(32), p_period CHAR(7))&#10;RETURNS NUMERIC AS $$&#10;  SELECT COALESCE(adjusted_amount - encumbered_amt - actual_amt, 0)&#10;  FROM budget_period WHERE cost_center_id = p_cc AND period = p_period;&#10;$$ LANGUAGE sql STABLE;&#10;&#10;-- 占用必须是原子的：先锁行再校验再写，否则并发下会超占&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION try_encumber(p_cc VARCHAR(32), p_period CHAR(7), p_amt NUMERIC)&#10;RETURNS BOOLEAN AS $$&#10;DECLARE avail NUMERIC;&#10;BEGIN&#10;  SELECT adjusted_amount - encumbered_amt - actual_amt INTO avail&#10;  FROM budget_period&#10;  WHERE cost_center_id = p_cc AND period = p_period&#10;  FOR UPDATE;                                    -- 行锁，防并发超占&#10;  IF avail IS NULL OR avail &lt; p_amt THEN&#10;    RETURN FALSE;&#10;  END IF;&#10;  UPDATE budget_period&#10;     SET encumbered_amt = encumbered_amt + p_amt&#10;   WHERE cost_center_id = p_cc AND period = p_period;&#10;  RETURN TRUE;&#10;END $$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> budget_period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  budget_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_center_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- YYYY-MM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  original_amount  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  adjusted_amount  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  encumbered_amt   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_amt       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cost_center_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 可用余额是派生量，绝不能作为可写字段单独维护</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> budget_available</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_cc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), p_period </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"